OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners raise concerns over
OL,4,Adata centre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have raised concerns over
OL,7,Fplans for a data centre in West Sussex
OL,8,Fwhich they say could add pressure to
OL,9,Fwater and electricity supplies.
OL,11,FA #1bn 100-megawatt facility is being
OL,12,Fproposed at Northlands Farm in
OL,13,FHickstead near the A23, but no official
OL,14,Fplans are understood to have been
OL,15,Fsubmitted to the local council.
OL,17,FNancy Duckels from Campaign to Protect
OL,18,FRural England (CPRE) Sussex said: "We
OL,19,Fare not anti-data centres, but what we
OL,20,Fare against is them being built in the
OL,21,Fwrong place with the wrong
OL,22,Finfrastructure."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
