OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners raise concerns over
OL,4,Adata centre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FYassin El Naggar, chief executive of
OL,7,FMeridian One, the company behind the
OL,8,Fproject, said the centre's "closed-loop
OL,9,Fcooling system" would reduce the need
OL,10,Ffor fresh water supplies.
